Package: mediasynclite
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, openssl, libgtk-3-0
Description: Upload music from your local machine to iBroadcast cloud
 MediaSync Lite is a native GTK application for Linux that scans a local
 music library, reads ID3v2/ID3v1 and Vorbis-comment tags where available,
 and uploads new tracks to your iBroadcast cloud account. It performs
 MD5- and tag-based duplicate detection so previously uploaded tracks are
 not sent again.
